AiTask qa_high_value_orders {
  label: "High-Value Orders"
  description: "Emails last week's orders worth $1,500 or more."
  brief: @md
    Load the write_ai_task_result skill before anything else.

    1. From @Dataset:ecommerce_official, get every order from last week (the last complete Monday–Sunday week) whose value is $1,500 or more, with its order ID, value, category, and date.
    2. Sort the orders by value, largest first.
    3. Write a short summary of those orders.

    Delivery: Email the summary to nhi.ty+qa@holistics.io.
  ;;
  acceptance_criteria: @md
    - Covers exactly the last complete Monday–Sunday week.
    - Lists every order worth $1,500 or more, and no others.
  ;;
}
